    "text": "Hai ricevuto i seguenti strumenti:\\n[VAR 0109(0000)] \u00D7[VAR 0202(0001)]\\n[VAR 0109(0002)] \u00D7[VAR 0202(0003)]\\n[VAR 0109(0004)] \u00D7[VAR 0202(0005)]\\n[VAR 0109(0006)] \u00D7[VAR 0202(0007)]\\n[VAR 0109(0008)] \u00D7[VAR 0202(0009)]\\n[VAR 0109(000A)] \u00D7[VAR 0202(000B)]"
  },
  {
